Here is a way that I learned to get things out of the shop.  I'm not
sure if its a bug or a feature; but it works.

Stand in the door way and wait for your pet to drop things at your feet.
Then step into the shop pick it up and step out.  When you pick it up you
are not charged for it.

   |--------
   |%[(!*d..	<-- your dog picks up a forked wand
   |!!.@.++     <-- the shop keeper
   |........
   |---@---     <-- you standing in the door

   |--------
   |%[(!*...
   |!!.@.++     <-- the shop keeper
   |...d....	<-- your dog drops a forked wand
   |---@---     <-- you standing in the door

   |--------
   |%[(!*...
   |!!.@.++     <-- the shop keeper
   |.../.d..	
   |---@---     <-- you standing in the door

   |--------
   |%[(!*...
   |!!.@.++     <-- the shop keeper
   |...@.d..	<-- you pickup a forked wand
   |---+---     

If you wait long enough you can get several objects out of the shop
without paying for them.  Does anyone know how you can have your pet
fetch a particular object?

